This directory contains a test for the parsing of strings like
"d(0,-10.3,12.8,100), d(1,-10.3,12.8,100), i(0, 0,5, 20), b(0, false, true, 10)".
This is needed in the context of parameter scans. The string indicates, which variables should be scanned
(each by its index in the value channel of its type), in which boundaries, and how many scan-points should be
used per variable.
